'''Grats! 2 Years!!''' is a limited time event from the [[Anniversary|Happy Birthday!]] stages that only appeared during [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP's]] [[Anniversary/2nd Year|2nd Anniversary Event]] and [[The Battle Cats|BCEN's]] [[Anniversary/1st Year|1st Anniversary Event]]. It was added in [[Version 3.0 Update|Version 3.0]].

