==Battleground==
*1 [[Birthday Cake|2nd Anniversary Birthday Cake]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*8 [[Doge]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*8 [[Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~26.67 seconds<sup>200f~800f</sup>.
*8 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~33.33 seconds<sup>200f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage, just spam [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]], [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cow Cat]] or any other fast moving and attacking units.

